      "body": "Move `settings.yaml` to `settings.toml` and drop the YAML loader.",
      "state": "open",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:3030/bottown/demo/issues/47"
    },
    "51": {
      "issue": 51,
      "title": "Rate-limit the public API",
      "body": "The public API has no rate limit. Add a token bucket per API token: 60 requests a minute, bursts of 10.\n\n- 429 with `Retry-After` when empty.\n- Configurable in `settings.toml`.",
